SUMMARY:Scenic AVL  - Waynesville Way - Weekend Wildcard
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nCarpooling: Please announce in the
  chat if you would like to carpool. I recommend 8:55 from 16 Regent Park B
 lvd\, Asheville (near Sam's Club)\, but I am coming from Hendersonville\, 
 so I won't be there.\n\nWeather: The weather forecast looks good until 12 
 noon\; we may shorten the route if the weather forecast changes. Bring rai
 n gear. 🌧️\n\nRating: Strenuous for Distance\nDistance: 9 miles\nElev
 ation Gain: 1000 feet\, in small chunks\nFeatures: Farmer's Market\, Rural
  farm views\, neighborhood charm\, nice downtown.\nWildlife: No bears\, bu
 t there are lots of birds and a few cows.\nPace: 3.2 mph when moving\, but
  we will stop here and there.\nSurface: Road\nDogs: On leash\nRoute: [Wayn
 esville Way](https://www.alltrails.com/explore/recording/activity-november
 -11-2024-5e38810)\n[.](https://maps.app.goo.gl/drFxX2TaTrZKWX9F8)\nCoffee 
 Break: 10:45 at Panacea coffee house. If you want to sleep in\, meet at Pa
 nacea. There's a free parking lot on Montgomery Street nearby. [https://ma
 ps.app.goo.gl/7Cw7n9YHtPvmLLaD8](https://maps.app.goo.gl/7Cw7n9YHtPvmLLaD8
 )\n\nMountain Research Station: We are walking down Test Farm Road across 
 the NC Agricultural Extension Mountain Research Station. Please sign in us
 ing the [Visitor Registration](https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSf
 DFCDqvA7x7AkL8A2jaLthTf2lSQBwlEyC99r-H4SVDsqQaA/viewform) website.\n\nScen
 ic Asheville Series: This hike is a wildcard \, meaning that it can be a s
 ubstitute for any of the other hikes.\nThere are [10 hikes ](https://docs.
 google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XUm-X1_OhxKIi8JU5rhjsW37cAl4yYx8yB_NEjjI5Lk/edi
 t?usp=drivesdk)in the series\; hike 9 of them and receive an [attractive b
 adge ](https://docs.google.com/drawings/d/1goXUXfzUBqhB4_UeCxodlk4ZPeCCgqZ
 rWK2EUJvk_vI/edit)for your pack. Badgers can always attend a hike\, even i
 f on the waiting list. See our [highlights here](https://docs.google.com/p
 resentation/d/18cFp2Uhw8XthOFXxekBpt2LGP6ww-V7kmXQExI7Y0h0/)!\n\nRSVP and 
 On-Time Start:\n\n- Call (do not text) the hike leader on the day of the h
 ike if you can't find the start 828-290-0886\n-\nDisclaimer and Release of
  Liability:\nThis activity involves hiking on city streets that may have t
 raffic. Participants are responsible for their safety on streets and trail
 s. The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide.
  The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign 
 up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and volunt
 arily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages aris
 ing from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addition\, 
 you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup terms: [https://www.meetup.co
 m/terms](https://www.meetup.com/terms)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/315975226
 /
