SUMMARY:Pisgah Ridge & Graveyard Ridge
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\n**THE HIKE:** Start at Graveyard F
 ield parking lot. Cross the BRP and take a social trail south\, up to Pisg
 ah Ridge. At the ridge line\, turn right and proceed along the ridge line 
 until reaching Black Balsam Road (FSR 816). Take a social trail that paral
 lels Black Balsam Rd to Art Loeb/MST. Climb to where that trail crosses Bl
 ack Balsam Rd. and then continue on the MST. We'll take a break along this
  section. Hike down to Black Balsam Junction and take the Graveyard Ridge 
 Trail (not MST) and Graveyard Ridge Trail Connector trail back to the park
 ing lot.\n\n**TRAIL CONDITIONS:** Some sections of the social trails are o
 vergrown. LONG TROUSERS ARE REQUIRED. Also\, bring rain gear for later in 
 the day. Distance is about 7 miles\, and pace will be about 2 mph. I expec
 t spending 4 hrs on the trail. Elevation is easily 1\,000+ feet. This is n
 ot an easy hike. However\, we should escape the heat of the lower elevatio
 ns. Please note that we are starting a bit early to avoid afternoon shower
 s. Not a dog friendly hike.\n\nAt the John Rock parking area\, we'll bypas
 s the new but unfinished/unopened trailhead for the new connector trail do
 wn to Graveyard Field. See photos.\n\n**CAR POOL:** Meet at the French Bro
 ad River Overlook\, Blue Ridge Parkway\, at 8:00 A.M. for carpool up to Gr
 aveyard Field. Car pool is not mandatory.\n\n**RELEASE OF LIABILITY:** The
  organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guide. The f
 unction of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sign up or 
 participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and voluntarily 
 agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages arising fr
 om\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addition\, you ac
 knowledge that you agree to the Meetup Terms of Service: [https://help.mee
 tup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-43
 61-8afc-854a4f586c82.](https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447
 252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316011105
 /
